<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Instant twisted tech for the strongest battle grounds
if you use this macro instant twisted  becomes super easy
you need 0.1 roblox sensitivity and 9 level of mouse sensitivity to do this tech correctly
screen resolution: 1366 x 678
guide: 
1. stand right next to your enemy
2. Step back a little when you do ur 4 m1
3. activate macro Instantly
for the technique to work the enemy must have 80-200 ping!
I recommend learning how to do regular twisted first
WARNING!
do not try this macro on dummy
dummy has 0 ping, so tech will not work</Description>
    <Comment>The stongest battle grounds tech</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 20 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 64
MoveR -1200 0
Delay 64
MoveR 2500 0</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>